### Result calculation

Calculate delivery success rate as:

``` text
Delivery Success Rate (%) =
    (Unique messages delivered / Unique messages sent) * 100
```

Calculate end-to-end latency for each successfully delivered message as:

``` text
Latency = Destination receipt timestamp - Source creation timestamp
```

Report the mean latency as the arithmetic average across successfully
delivered messages. State how undelivered messages and timeouts are
handled.

